## 地图渲染实体 (Map)

```typescript
// 地图渲染项 (聚合或实体)
interface MapRenderItem {
  id: string; // Unique ID
  type: 'cluster' | 'user' | 'group' | 'moment';
  location: GeoPoint;
  
  // 聚合数据
  cluster?: {
    count: number;
    label?: string;
    preview_urls?: string[];
  };

  // 实体数据 (User/Group/Moment)
  entity?: {
    title: string;
    subtitle?: string;
    cover_url?: string;
    payload_id: string; // 原始业务ID
    category?: string;  // 业务分类
  };
}
```

